## Portfolio purpose

Present Raghvendra Singh for Principal / Staff Product Design, AI product building, design systems, product strategy, consulting, workshops, and selected founder work.

## Project guardrails

- Optimize for recruiter and client comprehension before visual novelty.
- Show decisions, constraints, evidence, and outcomes instead of decorative process.
- Never invent research, metrics, responsibilities, experiments, or business impact.
- Keep founder products concise unless evidence supports a deeper case study.
- Preserve clear paths to case studies, resume, and contact.
- Treat accessibility, responsive behavior, performance, and SEO as release requirements.
- Use VengeanceUI only as an optional implementation reference.
- Do not change analytics, deployment, routing, or production configuration unless required by the task.
- Before shipping, run available typecheck, lint, tests, and production build.
- Report any skipped verification.
